  "display_title": "A Reward For the Crying Child!",
  "description": "*\"Because you keep crying... I'm so attracted to you.\"* \n\nPoor college student Kang Si-Woo gets into a huge fight with Han Do-Woon, a top student at a group gathering, whom he usually dislikes. Then, Si-Woo accidentally witnesses Do-Woon crying while drunk. At that moment, Si-Woo's body starts to heat up uncontrollably, and he finally asks Do-Woon, \"Have you ever had sex with a guy?\"\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated) \n\n*Note: Part of Blühen's Ssasek Danpyeonseon (싸섹 단편선) Collection.*",
